# banto ignore list — sample
# Location: ~/.claude/banto-ignore
#
# In the paths listed here (and their subtrees), the SessionStart /
# UserPromptSubmit hooks exit early. Concretely:
#   - Suppresses auto-creation of .ai-context/
#   - Suppresses appending the AI Context section to .gitignore
#   - Stops all hook behavior such as context injection and checkpoint recommendations
#
# Format:
#   - One path per line
#   - Lines starting with # are comments; blank lines are ignored
#   - ~ / ~/ expands to $HOME
#   - Trailing comments use ` #` (a leading space is required)
#   - Matching is prefix-based (suppressed when the CWD is the listed path itself or under it)
#
# Existing .ai-context/ and .gitignore are not modified (remove them manually).
#
# Examples:

# General scratch directories
~/scratch
~/tmp

# Client work (projects where in-house rules forbid AI assistance)
# ~/Documents/clients/acme-corp

# Prototypes / experiments
# ~/code/experiments
